        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSHP916, Dome Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTypically dome door stops are used in commercial buildings such as schools, shopping malls and offices. The door stop's base height is 9/16\". The High Profile Dome Floor Door Stop comes packaged with mounting hardware. It is made of solid brass and is available in 9 different finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSHP916U-specifications.gif?v=1704354707\" width=\"395\" height=\"136\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSHP916 Dome Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/low-profile-solid-brass-floor-dome-door-stop-deltana-dslp316\"><b>Deltana DSLP316 Low Profile Dome Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DSHP916 High Profile Dome Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Base Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Height: 9/16\" Please insure you have enough distance under the door's bottom to clear the door stop's base height. </li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Width: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: White</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DSHP916.pdf?v=1704262211\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSHP916 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
