                "description": "Dome Door Stop Deltana DSHP916 - Typically dome door stops are used in commercial buildings such as schools, shopping malls and offices. The door stop's base height is 9/16 inch. The High Profile Dome Floor Door Stop comes packaged with mounting hardware. It is made of solid brass and is available in 9 different finishes.",
